    <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; margin:2rem 0 1rem; color:var(--text);">WES Evaluation & 4.0 GPA Conversion</h3>
    <p>World Education Services (WES) evaluates credentials for US/Canada admissions. They do <strong>not</strong> use a simple multiplier. Instead, they recalculate from your semester-wise transcripts.</p>
    <div class="seo-formula-block" style="background:var(--result-bg); border:1px solid var(--border); border-left:3px solid var(--primary); border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin:1.2rem 0;">
