      <div class="formula-text" style="font-family:'Courier New', monospace; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--text);">GPA = (CGPA ÷ 10) × 4</div>
      <div class="formula-example" style="font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--muted); margin-top:6px;">Example: 8.0 CGPA → (8.0 ÷ 10) × 4 = <strong>3.2 GPA</strong></div>
